    Comparison is case-insensitive.

    Args:
        value: String representation of a boolean.

    Returns:
        True or False based on the parsed value.

    Raises:
        ValueError: If the string is not a recognized boolean value.
    """
    truthy = {"true", "yes", "1", "on", "enabled"}
    falsy = {"false", "no", "0", "off", "disabled"}
